cal and biotech companies, hospitals and clinical diagnostic labs, universities, research institutions and government agencies, as well as environmental, industrial, research and development, quality and process control settings. Our global team delivers an unrivaled combination of innovative technologies, purchasing convenience and pharmaceutical services through our industry-leading brands, including Thermo Scientific, Applied Biosystems, Invitrogen, Fisher Scientific, Unity Lab Services, Patheon and PPD.","zh":"Thermo Fisher Scientific Inc.（在本文件中也稱為「Thermo Fisher」、「我們」、「公司」或「註冊人」）是科學服務領域的全球領導者。我們的使命是幫助我們的客戶讓世界更健康、更乾淨、更安全。我們為製藥和生物技術公司、醫院和臨床診斷實驗室、大學、研究機構和政府機構以及環境、工業、研發、品質和製程控制機構的客戶提供服務。我們的全球團隊透過我們的業界領先品牌（包括 Thermo Scientific、Applied Biosystems、Invitrogen、Fisher Scientific、Unity Lab Services、Patheon 和 PPD）提供無與倫比的創新技術、採購便利性和製藥服務組合。"},{"en":"We continuously increase our depth of capabilities across our broad portfolio of innovative products and services and leverage our extensive global channels to address our customers' needs. We do this through organic investments in research and development, capacity and capabilities and through acquisitions. Our goal is to enable our customers to be more productive in an increasingly competitive business environment, enable them to accelerate innovation, solve their challenges and advance their important work.","zh":"我們不斷增強我們廣泛的創新產品和服務組合的能力深度，並利用我們廣泛的全球管道來滿足客戶的需求。我們透過對研發、產能和能力的有機投資以及收購來實現這一目標。我們的目標是使我們的客戶在競爭日益激烈的商業環境中提高生產力，加速創新，解決挑戰並推進重要工作。"},{"en":"We report our business in four segments: Life Sciences Solutions, Analytical Instruments, Specialty Diagnostics, and Laboratory Products and Biopharma Services.","zh":"我們將業務分為四個部分：生命科學解決方案、分析儀器、專業診斷、實驗室產品和生物製藥服務。"}],"markets":[{"en":"We report our business in four segments: Life Sciences Solutions, Analytical Instruments, Specialty Diagnostics, and Laboratory Products and Biopharma Services.","zh":"我們將業務分為四個部分：生命科學解決方案、分析儀器、專業診斷、實驗室產品和生物製藥服務。"},{"en":"Through our Life Sciences Solutions segment, we provide an extensive portfolio of reagents, instruments and consumables used in biological and medical research, discovery and production of new drugs and vaccines as well as diagnosis of disease. These products and services are used by customers in pharmaceutical, biotechnology, agricultural, clinical, healthcare, academic, and government markets. Life Sciences Solutions includes three primary businesses: biosciences, genetic sciences, and bioproduction.","zh":"透過我們的生命科學解決方案部門，我們提供廣泛的試劑、儀器和消耗品組合，用於生物和醫學研究、新藥和疫苗的發現和生產以及疾病診斷。這些產品和服務供製藥、生物技術、農業、臨床、醫療保健、學術和政府市場的客戶使用。生命科學解決方案包括三個主要業務：生物科學、遺傳科學和生物生產。"}],"customers":[{"en":"We market and sell our products and services through a direct sales force, customer-service professionals, electronic commerce and third-party distributors. Our global team delivers a combination of innovative technologies, purchasing convenience and pharmaceutical services through our industry-leading brands, including Thermo Scientific, Applied Biosystems, Invitrogen, Fisher Scientific, Unity Lab Services, Patheon and PPD.","zh":"我們透過直銷團隊、客戶服務專業人員、電子商務和第三方經銷商行銷和銷售我們的產品和服務。我們的全球團隊透過我們領先業界的品牌（包括 Thermo Scientific、Applied Biosystems、Invitrogen、Fisher Scientific、Unity Lab Services、Patheon 和 PPD）提供創新技術、採購便利性和製藥服務的組合。"},{"en":"We have approximately 14,000 sales personnel including highly trained technical specialists who enable us to better meet the needs of our more technical end-users. We also provide customers with product standardization and other supply-chain-management services to reduce procurement costs.","zh":"我們擁有約 14,000 名銷售人員，其中包括訓練有素的技術專家，他們使我們能夠更好地滿足技術含量更高的最終用戶的需求。我們也為客戶提供產品標準化和其他供應鏈管理服務，以降低採購成本。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The company encounters aggressive and able competition in virtually all of the markets we serve. Because of the diversity of our products and services, we face many different types of competitors and competition. Our competitors include a broad range of manufacturers, third-party distributors and service providers. Competitive climates in many of the markets we serve are characterized by changing technology and customer demands that require continuing research and development. Our success primarily depends on the following factors:","zh":"該公司幾乎在我們服務的所有市場都遇到了激烈且有力的競爭。由於我們的產品和服務的多樣性，我們面臨許多不同類型的競爭對手和競爭。我們的競爭對手包括廣泛的製造商、第三方分銷商和服務提供者。我們所服務的許多市場的競爭環境的特徵是不斷變化的技術和客戶需求，需要持續的研究和開發。我們的成功主要取決於以下因素："},{"en":"technical performance and advances in technology (including artificial intelligence) that result in new products and services, and improved price/performance ratios;","zh":"技術性能和技術進步（包括人工智慧）帶來新產品和服務，並提高性價比；"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Laboratory Products & Biopharma Services","val":23984000000,"zh":"實驗室產品和生物製藥服務"},{"name":"Life Sciences Solutions","val":10374000000,"zh":"生命科學解決方案"},{"name":"Analytical Instruments","val":7554000000,"zh":"分析儀器"},{"name":"Specialty Diagnostics","val":4676000000,"zh":"專業診斷"}],"total":44556000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Consumables","val":18664000000,"zh":"耗材"},{"name":"Service","val":18592000000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"Instruments","val":7301000000,"zh":"儀器儀表"}],"total":44556000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"North America","val":23033000000,"zh":"北美洲"},{"name":"Non Us","val":22316000000,"zh":"非我們"},{"name":"US","val":22240000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Europe","val":11826000000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":8101000000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Other Regions","val":1597000000,"zh":"其他地區"}],"total":44556000000}},"peers":["DHR","SYK","ZTS","BDX","ISRG"]}}